#: ../../source/docs/learning-the-ardupilot-codebase.rst:5
#: f134b10aae8c4fecb03aa8195126403a
msgid "Learning the ArduPilot Codebase"
msgstr "学习 ArduPilot 代码库"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-the-ardupilot-codebase.rst:7
#: 06a8d1116525471aaf1f156967d04ff7
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot code base is quite large (about 700k lines for the core "
"ardupilot git tree) and can be quite intimidating to a new user. This page "
"is meant to give some suggestions on how to come up to speed on the code "
"quickly. It assumes you already are familiar with the key concepts of C++ "
"and the many of the examples currently assume you will be exploring the code"
" on a Linux system."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 代码库相当庞大（核心 ardupilot git 仓库约有 70 "
"万行代码），对新用户来说可能颇具压迫感。本页旨在提供一些快速熟悉代码的建议。这里假设你已熟悉 C++ 的基本概念，且大多数示例假定你将在 Linux "
"系统上探索代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-the-ardupilot-codebase.rst:14
#: 5c45f4a6b0b14a5ea665fa92755064a0
msgid ""
"This page and the pages linked below are designed to be used as a tutorial. "
"You should work through each page step by step, trying things for yourself "
"as you go. If you think some important information is missing or could be "
"improved then please `open an issue for the wiki "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__ and we will try to "
"get to it when we can."
msgstr ""
"本页及下方链接的页面按教程设计。你应逐页按步骤操作，边学边亲手尝试。如果你认为缺少重要信息或有可改进之处，请 `给 wiki 开一个 issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/issues>`__，我们会尽快处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-the-ardupilot-codebase.rst:20
#: 329f1b51b7f94a8aafbab4d43c29df75
msgid "Tutorial steps"
msgstr "教程步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-the-ardupilot-codebase.rst:54
#: 208d3043118b433cb6859adfc7b87746
msgid ""
"There are currently five vehicles in ArduPilot (Copter, Plane, Rover, Sub, "
"and Antenna Tracker) and while there are a lot of common elements between "
"different vehicle types, they are each different. For now we only have a "
"detailed description of the code structure for the Copter code."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 目前支持五种飞行器（Copter、Plane、Rover、Sub 和 Antenna "
"Tracker），不同飞行器类型之间虽有许多共同元素，但各自也有差异。目前我们只对 Copter 代码结构进行了详细说明。"

